# Cloudflare Workers static assets read this file; it is not served.
# A typed /privacy or /terms lands on the text at its real address.
/privacy /legal/privacy 301
/terms /legal/terms 301
# The Mac app's download and update feed live in the R2 bucket `braindog-desktop`, at its own name; these addresses are
# the ones the app (its update feed) and /download name, so they never change when the files move
# (tools/desktop/release.mjs --publish uploads them).
/desktop/* https://download.brain.dog/:splat 302
# The plugin store was /packs until 3 November and /addons until later that day. An old link or a shared listing
# lands on the same plugin at /plugins, in one hop.
/packs /plugins 301
/packs/* /plugins/:splat 301
/addons /plugins 301
/addons/* /plugins/:splat 301
